        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset H, Traditional Half-Round Hancock Knobset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nElegance meets durability in the traditional Hancock Knobset. Its looks, as well as its workmanship is designed to last. The classic half-round shape of this Kwikset Knob lends the perfect finishing touch to almost any door. It is available in four functions including half dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry with an ANSI/BHMA A156.2 grade 2 security rating. Easy to install, it fits most standard pre-drilled doors; and it has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches for door 1-3/8 inches thick up to 1-3/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Kwikset Classic Hancock Door Knob Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Featuring Smartkey Security Re-Key Technology. The Lock You Can Re-Key Yourself In Seconds</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Kwikset Hancock Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> An inactive knob for use as a pull or to match trim. This non-operational knob is for one side of the door. Complete Set - 1 knob and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior knob engages privacy lock on both knobs; emergency release hole is on exterior knob. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the knob from the interior. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Hancock Door Knob Set, Kwikset H",
                "description": "Kwikset H Hancock Knob Signature Series - Elegance meets durability in the traditional Hancock Knobset. Its looks, as well as its workmanship is designed to last. The classic half-round shape of this Kwikset Knob lends the perfect finishing touch to almost any door. It is available in four functions including half dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry with an ANSI/BHMA A156.2 grade 2 security rating. Easy to install, it fits standard pre-drilled doors; and it has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches for door 1-3/8 inches thick up to 1-3/4 inches thick.",
                "keywords": "KWI-H, Traditional Half-Round Hancock Knobset, Kwikset Hancock Knob Signature Series, kwikset 788h dummy knobs, kwikset 720h passage knobs, kwikset 730h privacy knobs, kwikset 740h keyed entry knobs, knob for doors, Hancock door knob sets, keyed door knob locks, classic knobs, traditional knobsets, half-round knobs, half round door knobs,"
